steps.description:
Human or operator step: it edits shared routing on the project bead. Both fields are shared aggregates, so use the flags that append; a bare `-f slack_channel=` or `-f channel_roles=` replaces the whole value and un-wires every other channel.

```sh
kd update <project-bead-id> --field-append slack_channel={{channel_id}}
kd update <project-bead-id> --field-set channel_roles.{{channel_id}}={{role}}
```

The first makes the project own the channel; the second makes {{role}} the channel's default handler, so an @mention spawns it and its agent cards route back here. See Step 4b of gardenio/docs/onboarding-new-project-and-role.md.
